  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "After nine-nine reincarnation blades strike Lord Huang Shi, his injuries hold no flowing blood. The wounds are filled with blade path dao marks that keep emitting blade qi into his organs.",
      "chapters": [
        1434
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_huang_shi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "General dao marks and attainment levels are covered on dao marks and attainment.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_dao_marks"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Autumn blade plain is full of blade path dao marks and forms countless edge Gu naturally. Drinking blade wine under the plain is not a natural product; it forms when Meng Tu’s bloodstains seep into the ground and merge with those blade path dao marks.",
      "chapters": [
        1563
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "marks-that-birth-edge-gu",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_edge_immortal_gu",
        "res_drinking_blade_wine",
        "char_meng_tribe_meng_tu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The plain as a resource point is covered on autumn blade plain.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "marks-that-birth-edge-gu",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_autumn_blade_plain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Meng Tu self-detonates, almost all edge Gu on autumn blade plain are destroyed, but their growth potential rises because his blade path dao marks are engraved into the land.",
      "chapters": [
        1565
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "self-detonation-engraving",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meng Tu uses the blade path dao marks to cover autumn blade plain with an environment similar to an immortal battlefield, cutting off further messaging after his first alert. After the fight, surging blade path dao marks fill the air, and the dense marks stab into skin with bursts of pain.",
      "chapters": [
        1566
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "battlefield-like-cover",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In Fang Yuan’s previous life, Meng Tu self-detonated and left blade path dao marks in autumn blade plain, making the place’s potential extraordinary. In this life Fang Yuan kills him before that self-detonation and strips the plain, ending that leftover potential.",
      "chapters": [
        1752
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
